{
  "format": "story-pages-v1",
  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-snowy-zigzags-v4.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "964212fa49e7d77e825798c5c23c61e1fe0a7974b30c3a6324b51d1e708a41ad",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3ba7aca8d9b105aa9a4bd58f21252920da834c4b3e72938bf68d43dc41d0a2a8",
      "text": "Wukong and the\nSnowy Zigzags",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "84a6807bb1a86d8481f3d64cf24e1617d88267141a44c0469ceab19476048b37",
      "text": "Jade Rabbit waved.\n“Welcome, Wukong!”\n“Welcome, Princess Iron Fan!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c12d7c4a650bcc6fe8a3728c9f70e22ae9073d7404c76099ac7fb884eea37e4b",
      "text": "Gold staff. Silver fan.\nThey tucked them in the cubby.\nBoots on. Skis ready.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "dedbf1a2d19057940a70e2c4bc5fdad5f99b95af65fa3a603e2e9c2fe26dde5e",
      "text": "“My feet got long!” Wukong\nwobbled. His skis slid apart.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ae435a3787b2c0ef0d591fae11f1fc703db77d8b941b94a7eb9d1c6840d5550a",
      "text": "Coach Otter checked each\nhelmet. “Stay on the beginner\nhill.” They listened.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3414f7ba9af5e459cbfce2d20f1fac6d24159cd2bdef1da903d59cc33e13b043",
      "text": "Wukong stepped too fast.\nPlop! A soft snow sit.\nHis tail wore a snowball.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6b3501d1958edfbcf41f0289c52d7d301cd1c1b82b0a9431ce6575d6e2799951",
      "text": "Iron Fan sat in soft snow. “A\nroyal snow cushion!” she laughed.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5f37e2b692d35e92a4dcb147cc0becabec542d498d9bc3e704fef16840c62e51",
      "text": "She stopped with a swish.\nThen she looked at the\nturn. It felt too big.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "609c30088e6d9d6c513b649be185a2a0c37e94155c704eacb22faf06a5118a1f",
      "text": "Wukong bent his knees. “Easy,\nfeet!” He looked down the hill.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e3a5fca274da1c7186a2d2cdb1a611fdc0f193caf845fa5f102b0044cc38a3f7",
      "text": "Coach made a wide flag path.\nJade cheered from the side:\n“Take your time!”\nWukong listened.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a1076250a875a273169b65cb91d69e83822451f7503967b7cf5d86d0c325af8e",
      "text": "Iron Fan breathed out. A little\nbend. A little turn. Her skis\ncurved around the flag.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9b51ac02ecbf2bb24c11f45b9762793c7e80e0cdfa34683324d783ba6c271f5a",
      "text": "Wukong bent, then turned.\n“Slow. Turn. Stop.”\nHe stopped by the flag.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "91c0a904a8ce26b6967510f2a8e790492b0a89f64eac2485d4225072d1ee3af2",
      "text": "They looked back. Two wiggly\ntracks crossed the snow. “Two\nsnowy ribbons!” cried Jade.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c9bbdba5c9abab2b6900de8c8632b891b4b4e2a8b44cccd224ca70075e4bdf17",
      "text": "Three mugs of warm cocoa. A\nbowl of fish crackers. They\nblew gently. Sip, sip.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8bee0ad29692d6795b042dd3951e2aec3e9e1bf96b13b3d252fff25ab8ff0823",
      "text": "“My fish can’t ski!” “Mine can\nswim... in my tummy!” Crunch,\ncrunch.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "eef9670c776993cee5c00c25e3f14918e92116b0ca110c3c8d5c8d580e76d8ab",
      "text": "They drew their zigzag routes.\nJade added tiny snowflakes.\nOutside, snow fell softly.\nInside, the cocoa stayed warm.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6b94c8febe5feb6a7e982144d0c240be01010efc5f336537724b56e5cfcd50ae",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.",
